  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1 sweet onion, chopped",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "2 tomatoes, chopped",
    "0.5 cup water, divided",
    "1 cube chicken bouillon",
    "1 large zucchini, thinly sliced",
    "ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nCjyzEyAY26mnMj3Fw5dbqS5WZ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/202392-sauteed-zucchini-DDMFS-28412-step-01-71ca55262add4f02994d60d58b515593.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/202392/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add onion; cook and stir until onion is tender, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jwRRNG_XDrg3idkAIv2tIPrv-xU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/202392-sauteed-zucchini-DDMFS-28421-step-02-004d31cc501e4764a4239e75d8378702.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/202392/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add garlic; cook and stir until fragrant, about 1 minute more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IaaKxI8x7DfeC8Ski4RBQEy-yrw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/202392-sauteed-zucchini-DDMFS-28423-step-03-85ee10265c6d4d308393c5a03b3ecb20.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/202392/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir tomatoes and 1/4 cup water into the mixture; cover. Cook, stirring occasionally, until tomatoes have reduced slightly, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NgstjQsaqXXCLo9sPSuYFoSD4qI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/202392-sauteed-zucchini-DDMFS-28424-step-04-c922d02376514f54b1a6cf92de05cdfc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/202392/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour another 1/4 cup water into the skillet. Add bouillon cube and stir until bouillon is dissolved. Add zucchini; continue cooking until zucchini is tender, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u_3Q2NketwOfuP5kD92dF_BVVAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/202392-sauteed-zucchini-DDMFS-28428-step-05-ea3b691b7d4b473b84dafd870b08c8db.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/202392/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with black pepper and serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
